        "displayLabel": "定义 · 1 · 三维把手体",
        "shortTitle": "三维把手体",
        "title": "三维把手体",
        "statement": "三维把手体是由一个$0$-把手（$3$-球）和$g$个$1$-把手组成的三维流形。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:heegaard-splitting",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 2 · Heegaard 分解",
        "shortTitle": "Heegaard 分解",
        "title": "Heegaard 分解",
        "statement": "闭、定向、连通三维流形$Y$可表示为两个把手体沿公共边界的并；公共边界是亏格为$g$的曲面$\\Sigma_g$。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:heegaard-diagram",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 3 · Heegaard 图",
        "shortTitle": "Heegaard 图",
        "title": "Heegaard 图",
        "statement": "Heegaard 图由曲面$\\Sigma_g$及两组各含$g$条互不相交嵌入圆的曲线集$\\alpha,\\beta$组成；每组曲线将$\\Sigma_g$切成带$2g$个穿孔的球面，且各圆在相应把手体中界定嵌入的$2$-球。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:trisection",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 4 · 四维流形三分",
        "shortTitle": "四维流形三分",
        "title": "四维流形三分",
        "statement": "光滑、连通、闭、定向四维流形$X$的三分是分解$X=X_1\\cup X_2\\cup X_3$，其中各$X_i$是$4$维把手体，各二重交为$3$维把手体，三重交为Heegaard曲面$\\Sigma_g$。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:open-book",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 5 · 开放书分解",
        "shortTitle": "开放书分解",
        "title": "开放书分解",
        "statement": "三维边界$Y$的开放书分解是由纽结$L\\subset Y$（绑定）及纤维化$Y-L\\to S^1$组成的分解，其纤维称为页且页的边界为$L$。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=2"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:monodromy",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 6 · 三分单值化",
        "shortTitle": "三分单值化",
        "title": "三分单值化",
        "statement": "三分图的单值化衡量沿$B^2$逆时针移动某个把手体时发生的最小把手滑动总数，即将该把手体带回自身所需滑动数的最小值。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=2"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:theorem:monodromy-elementary-manifolds",
        "entryClass": "claim",
        "claimKind": "theorem",
        "displayLabel": "定理 · 1 · 单值化判别",
        "shortTitle": "单值化判别",
        "title": "单值化判别",
        "statement": "若三分的单值化为$0$或$1$，则相应四维流形必为四个基本四维流形之一。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=2",
        "sourceReference": "Kirby 与 Thompson，文献6《A new invariant of 4-manifolds》"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:dehn-surgery",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 7 · Dehn 手术",
        "shortTitle": "Dehn 手术",
        "title": "Dehn 手术",
        "statement": "沿边界$Y$中的带框架结$K$附加$2$-把手后，从$K$的实心环面邻域$V$中取出并重新粘回实心环面；粘合子午线曲线与$K$的框架曲线，称为Dehn手术。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=3"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:r-link",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 8 · R-链",
        "shortTitle": "R-链",
        "title": "R-链",
        "statement": "若$S^3$中的$n$分量链经Dehn手术得到$\\#_n(S^1\\times S^2)$，则称其为$R$-链。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=3"
      },
      {
